版本及制度種類待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-120","person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5_A","surfaces":["太子撃"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p046","quote":"烈侯元年，魏文侯伐中山，使太子撃守之。六年，魏、韓、趙皆相立爲諸侯，追尊獻子爲獻侯。"}],"rationale":"限本篇連續敘事、是為、諡稱及明示親屬語境。周舍／周捨按諫臣同段暫接；兩位周、中山武公與趙武公、子朝與趙朝分開。圍鄭晉陽知伯與較早知伯文子仍分候選，不因同爵或熟知姓名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji044-032","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","surfaces":["子撃","武侯","魏武侯"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p012","quote":"六年，城少梁。十三年，使子撃圍繁、龐，出其民。十六年，伐秦，筑臨晉元裏。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p013","quote":"十七年，伐中山，使子撃守之，趙倉唐傅之。子撃逢文侯之師田子方於朝謌，引車避，下謁。田子方不爲禮。子撃因問曰：『富貴者驕人乎？且貧賤者驕人乎？』子方曰：『亦貧賤者驕人耳。夫諸侯而驕人則失其國，大夫而驕人則失其家。貧賤者，行不合，言不用，則去之楚、越，若脱屣然，柰何其同之哉！』子撃不懌而去。西攻秦，至鄭而還，筑雒陰、合陽。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p016","quote":"廿五年，子撃生子罃。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p022","quote":"卅八年，伐秦，敗我武下，得其將識。是歳，文侯卒，子撃立，是爲武侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p023","quote":"魏武侯元年，趙敬侯初立，公子朔爲亂，不勝，奔魏，與魏襲邯鄲，魏敗而去。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p028","quote":"十六年，伐楚，取魯陽。武侯卒，子罃立，是爲惠王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","quote":"惠王元年，初，武侯卒也，子罃與公中緩爭爲太子。公孫頎自宋入趙，自趙入韓，謂韓懿侯曰：『魏罃與公中緩爭爲太子，君亦聞之乎？今魏罃得王錯，挾上黨，固半國也。因而除之，破魏必矣，不可失也。』懿侯説，乃與趙成侯合軍并兵以伐魏，戰于濁澤，魏氏大敗，魏君圍。趙謂韓曰：『除魏君，立公中緩，割地而退，我且利。』韓曰：『不可。殺魏君，人必曰暴；割地而退，人必曰貪。不如兩分之。魏分爲兩，不彊於宋、衞，則我終无魏之患矣。』趙不聽。韓不説，以其少卒夜去。惠王之所以身不死，國不分者，二家謀不和也。若從一家之謀，則魏必分矣。故曰『君終无適子，其國可破也』。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、諡稱與連續事件暫接；同名不跨篇自動合併，苗裔、祖孫與父子分開，原字及版本疑讀尚待底本覆核。 第22段明示文侯子撃立是為武侯。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji044-ji","person_ids":["eva_gs1_9n5_A","nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA"],"canonical_person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5_A","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao","c-shiji-044-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p046","quote":"烈侯元年，魏文侯伐中山，使太子撃守之。六年，魏、韓、趙皆相立爲諸侯，追尊獻子爲獻侯。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0013"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p013","quote":"十七年，伐中山，使子撃守之，趙倉唐傅之。子撃逢文侯之師田子方於朝謌，引車避，下謁。田子方不爲禮。子撃因問曰：『富貴者驕人乎？且貧賤者驕人乎？』子方曰：『亦貧賤者驕人耳。夫諸侯而驕人則失其國，大夫而驕人則失其家。貧賤者，行不合，言不用，則去之楚、越，若脱屣然，柰何其同之哉！』子撃不懌而去。西攻秦，至鄭而還，筑雒陰、合陽。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0009","c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0020","c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0048","c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0137"]}],"rationale":"兩篇同記魏文侯伐中山而使太子／子撃守之，按父稱與守中山事件暫同指，太子用稱與父子來源各保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p046","text":"烈侯元年，魏文侯伐中山，使太子撃守之。六年，魏、韓、趙皆相立爲諸侯，追尊獻子爲獻侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"烈侯","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"魏文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"太子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0022","start":22,"end":27,"surface":"魏、韓、趙","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"獻子","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m046-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"獻侯","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p012","text":"六年，城少梁。十三年，使子撃圍繁、龐，出其民。十六年，伐秦，筑臨晉元裏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m012-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p013","text":"十七年，伐中山，使子撃守之，趙倉唐傅之。子撃逢文侯之師田子方於朝謌，引車避，下謁。田子方不爲禮。子撃因問曰：『富貴者驕人乎？且貧賤者驕人乎？』子方曰：『亦貧賤者驕人耳。夫諸侯而驕人則失其國，大夫而驕人則失其家。貧賤者，行不合，言不用，則去之楚、越，若脱屣然，柰何其同之哉！』子撃不懌而去。西攻秦，至鄭而還，筑雒陰、合陽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"趙倉唐","kind":"person","person_id":"f2n_1g8_h3m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"田子方","kind":"person","person_id":"3lq_wm9_1ov","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"田子方","kind":"person","person_id":"3lq_wm9_1ov","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"子方","kind":"person","person_id":"3lq_wm9_1ov","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m013-0137","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p016","text":"廿五年，子撃生子罃。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m016-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m016-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"子罃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p022","text":"卅八年，伐秦，敗我武下，得其將識。是歳，文侯卒，子撃立，是爲武侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"將識","kind":"person","person_id":"0wt_iyc_10n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"子撃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m022-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p023","text":"魏武侯元年，趙敬侯初立，公子朔爲亂，不勝，奔魏，與魏襲邯鄲，魏敗而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m023-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"魏武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m023-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"趙敬侯","kind":"person","person_id":"omb_zrk_gla","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m023-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"公子朔","kind":"person","person_id":"5gu_ab2_kmn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p028","text":"十六年，伐楚，取魯陽。武侯卒，子罃立，是爲惠王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m028-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m028-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"子罃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m028-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","text":"惠王元年，初，武侯卒也，子罃與公中緩爭爲太子。公孫頎自宋入趙，自趙入韓，謂韓懿侯曰：『魏罃與公中緩爭爲太子，君亦聞之乎？今魏罃得王錯，挾上黨，固半國也。因而除之，破魏必矣，不可失也。』懿侯説，乃與趙成侯合軍并兵以伐魏，戰于濁澤，魏氏大敗，魏君圍。趙謂韓曰：『除魏君，立公中緩，割地而退，我且利。』韓曰：『不可。殺魏君，人必曰暴；割地而退，人必曰貪。不如兩分之。魏分爲兩，不彊於宋、衞，則我終无魏之患矣。』趙不聽。韓不説，以其少卒夜去。惠王之所以身不死，國不分者，二家謀不和也。若從一家之謀，則魏必分矣。故曰『君終无適子，其國可破也』。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"子罃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"公中緩","kind":"person","person_id":"134_cb7_kph","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱與未定指代保留；公中緩爭太子不作已授太子，將識國別及孫子身份待核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"公孫頎","kind":"person","person_id":"v3z_8l6_18t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"韓懿侯","kind":"person","person_id":"brx_0of_9p8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魏罃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"公中緩","kind":"person","person_id":"134_cb7_kph","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱與未定指代保留；公中緩爭太子不作已授太子，將識國別及孫子身份待核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"魏罃","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"王錯","kind":"person","person_id":"eqc_fta_phm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"懿侯","kind":"person","person_id":"brx_0of_9p8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0098","start":98,"end":101,"surface":"趙成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"kh0_n9x_w13","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"魏君","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"魏君","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAA","status"